Z||000000||Alex2004||12-30-2000||05:17 PM||||Here are a few pic's of my Fiero, the top is the pic of my dad's Trans Am, he hit a deer on the way home from work in November,   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1424968&a=10669082&p=36598577&Sequence=0">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1424968&a=10669082&p=36597947&Sequence=0">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1424968&a=10669082&p=36599840&Sequence=0">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1424968&a=10669082&p=36599843&Sequence=0">  <BR>It's an 84 SE 4 cyl, we had a muffler shop but the exaust pipes on from the GT. We bought new front marker lights from GM, and we are going to buy sail panels from The Fiero Warehouse, and i'm going to install a 3rd brake light maybe later today once i get the light socket. Then we are getting the seats re-apulstered and then paint. Oh, we installed Kenwood eXcelon 4x6 speakers in the back, dad cut the holes for it. I have a Sony Xplod CD player 50 watts per speaker that we just bought, and we are going to buy new Kenwood 4x10's soon also. Just to let you know what has been/going to get done.<p>[This message has been edited by Alex2004 (edited 12-30-2000).]||||reg||10
